Adapted for the MicroTech project: the generic multi-chip, multi-board, and
framework reference tree was removed. The remaining skill is limited to the
supported Waveshare ESP32-S3 Touch AMOLED 1.8 hardware and directs agents to
current repository code, configuration, board documentation, and the
schematic for facts.
